WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Endoscopic Transnasal Skull Base Surgery: Anterior Cranial Fossa Resection.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Endoscopic view via the sphenoethmoidal recess revealing a benign osteoma of the anterior skull base.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:01:10.000
High-speed diamond burr dissection isolates the bony attachment without disrupting underlying dural membranes.

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Continuous saline irrigation cools the surgical field and maintains optic nerve visualization.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:56.000
Complete tumor delivery accomplished with multilayer vascularized nasoseptal flap reconstruction of the skull base defect.
